{"lines": ["Four glowing lights fell from the night sky into the sea. Navy divers went down, and found nothing.", "Shag Harbour, Nova Scotia, nineteen sixty-seven. Five young people on the road saw it first.", "A row of yellow lights, big as a plane, diving at forty-five degrees, whistling like a bomb.", "A hill hid it for ten seconds. When it cleared, one white light floated on the water.", "Police watched it drift on the tide, then it vanished before boats arrived.", "But here's the strange part. By morning, no aircraft was missing.", "Fishermen found only yellow foam. Navy divers searched the seabed for three days.", "Their verdict: not a trace, not a clue. And investigators noted no one actually saw it enter the water.", "So did it sink into that harbour, or did it never go in at all?"], "words": [["Four", 0.0, 0.22], ["glowing", 0.22, 0.5], ["lights", 0.5, 0.98], ["fell", 0.98, 1.38], ["from", 1.38, 1.72], ["the", 1.72, 1.84], ["night", 1.84, 2.04], ["sky", 2.04, 2.36], ["into", 2.36, 2.8], ["the", 2.8, 2.98], ["sea.", 2.98, 3.26], ["Navy", 3.9, 4.18], ["divers", 4.18, 4.54], ["went", 4.54, 4.94], ["down,", 4.94, 5.3], ["and", 5.3, 5.88], ["found", 5.88, 6.1], ["nothing.", 6.1, 6.56], ["Shag", 7.221, 7.46], ["Harbour,", 7.46, 7.78], ["Nova", 7.78, 8.26], ["Scotia,", 8.26, 8.86], ["nineteen", 9.5, 9.838], ["sixty-seven.", 9.838, 10.26], ["Five", 11.4, 11.74], ["young", 11.74, 12.0], ["people", 12.0, 12.36], ["on", 12.36, 12.68], ["the", 12.68, 12.8], ["road", 12.8, 13.06], ["saw", 13.06, 13.4], ["it", 13.4, 13.58], ["first.", 13.58, 13.78], ["A", 14.6, 14.64], ["row", 14.64, 14.86], ["of", 14.86, 15.14], ["yellow", 15.14, 15.36], ["lights,", 15.36, 15.82], ["big", 16.36, 16.6], ["as", 16.6, 16.78], ["a", 16.78, 16.9], ["plane,", 16.9, 17.2], ["diving", 17.84, 18.02], ["at", 18.02, 18.32], ["forty-five", 18.32, 18.66], ["degrees,", 18.66, 19.38], ["whistling", 19.98, 20.42], ["like", 20.42, 20.66], ["a", 20.66, 20.8], ["bomb.", 20.8, 20.98], ["A", 21.78, 21.82], 